{"ref":"passive:armor-item","lead":[{"k":"p","c":["Armor is a passive item in Vampire Survivors. It is unlocked by default."]},{"k":"p","c":["Armor increases ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," by 1 per level, reducing all damage dealt to the player by 1. It cannot reduce damage to 0. Armor also increases Retaliatory Damage by 10% additively and it is an additional multiplier on top of ",{"i":"Sprite-Might.png","w":18,"h":24,"r":"powerup:might"}," ",{"t":"Might","r":"powerup:might"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":["Armor can be found as a stage item in ",{"t":"Dairy Plant","r":"stage:dairy-plant"},", ",{"t":"Moongolow","r":"stage:moongolow"},", ",{"t":"Boss Rash","r":"stage:boss-rash"},", ",{"t":"Lake Foscari","r":"stage:lake-foscari"},", and ",{"t":"Abyss Foscari","r":"stage:abyss-foscari"},"."]}],"infobox":[{"title":"Passive item","rows":[{"label":"Release","cells":[["27 October 2021 (Update)"]]},{"label":"ID","cells":[["ARMOR"]]},{"label":"Player stat","cells":[[{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"}]]},{"label":"Rarity","cells":[["100"]]},{"label":"Max level","cells":[["5"]]},{"label":"Bonus per level","cells":[["-1"]]},{"label":"Stacking","cells":[["Additive"]]},{"label":"Max effect","cells":[["-5"]]},{"label":"Stage item","cells":[[{"t":"Dairy Plant","r":"stage:dairy-plant"},", ",{"t":"Moongolow","r":"stage:moongolow"},", ",{"t":"Boss Rash","r":"stage:boss-rash"},", ",{"t":"Lake Foscari","r":"stage:lake-foscari"},", ",{"t":"Abyss Foscari","r":"stage:abyss-foscari"}]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"levels","title":"Levels","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Armor has 5 levels. At max level, Armor provides +5 ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," and +50% Retaliatory Damage."]},{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Level"],"h":1},{"c":["Description"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 1"]},{"c":["\"Reduces incoming damage by 1. Increases retaliatory damage by 10%.\""]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 2"]},{"c":["Reduces incoming damage by 1."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 3"]},{"c":["Reduces incoming damage by 1."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 4"]},{"c":["Reduces incoming damage by 1."]}]},{"cells":[{"c":["Level 5"]},{"c":["Reduces incoming damage by 1."]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"evolutions","title":"Evolutions","blocks":[{"k":"table","rows":[{"h":1,"cells":[{"c":["Base weapon"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Passive item"],"h":1},{"c":[],"h":1},{"c":["Evolution"],"h":1}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Runetracer.png","w":22,"h":22,"r":"weapon:runetracer"},"\n",{"t":"Runetracer","r":"weapon:runetracer"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:armor-item"},"\nArmor"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-NO_FUTURE.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:no-future"},"\n",{"t":"NO FUTURE","r":"weapon:no-future"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Eskizzibur.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:eskizzibur"},"\n",{"t":"Eskizzibur","r":"weapon:eskizzibur"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:armor-item"},"\nArmor"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Legionnaire.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:legionnaire"},"\n",{"t":"Legionnaire","r":"weapon:legionnaire"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Sonic_Bloom.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:sonic-bloom"},"\n",{"t":"Sonic Bloom","r":"weapon:sonic-bloom"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:armor-item"},"\nArmor+",{"i":"Sprite-Weapon_Power-Up.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:weapon-power-up"},"\n",{"t":"Weapon Power-Up","r":"passive:weapon-power-up"}]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Wave_Beam.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:wave-beam"},"\n",{"t":"Wave Beam","r":"weapon:wave-beam"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Iron_Ball.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:iron-ball"},"\n",{"t":"Iron Ball","r":"weapon:iron-ball"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:armor-item"},"\nArmor"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Wrecking_Ball.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:wrecking-ball"},"\n",{"t":"Wrecking Ball","r":"weapon:wrecking-ball"}]}]},{"cells":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Keremet_Bubbles.png","w":28,"h":32,"r":"weapon:keremet-bubbles"},"\n",{"t":"Keremet Bubbles","r":"weapon:keremet-bubbles"}]},{"c":["+"]},{"c":["Max level:\n",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"passive:armor-item"},"\nArmor"]},{"c":["="]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Keremet_Morbus.png","w":32,"h":32,"r":"weapon:keremet-morbus"},"\n",{"t":"Keremet Morbus","r":"weapon:keremet-morbus"}]}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Armor bonuses reduce how much damage enemies deal to the player. Even if a single point sounds small, bonuses quickly add up. It is extremely effective with ",{"i":"Sprite-Crimson_Shroud.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:crimson-shroud"}," ",{"t":"Crimson Shroud","r":"weapon:crimson-shroud"}," as it caps all incoming damage at 10 already."]},{"c":["When paired with bonuses to health, such as the ",{"i":"Sprite-Hollow_Heart.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:hollow-heart"}," ",{"t":"Hollow Heart","r":"passive:hollow-heart"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Pummarola.png","w":18,"h":15,"r":"passive:pummarola"}," ",{"t":"Pummarola","r":"passive:pummarola"},", or by playing as ",{"i":"Sprite-Suor_Clerici.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:suor-clerici"}," ",{"t":"Clerici","r":"character:suor-clerici"},", damage reduction is even more powerful due to bigger health buffer."]},{"c":["Armor can allow the player to play much more recklessly, and at high levels, can greatly reduce the risk from bumping into enemies, on accident or on purpose."]},{"c":["When playing as characters with less Max Health, such as ",{"i":"Sprite-Poe_Ratcho.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:poe-ratcho"}," ",{"t":"Poe Ratcho","r":"character:poe-ratcho"}," or ",{"i":"Sprite-Exdash_Exiviiq.png","w":18,"h":19,"r":"character:exdash-exiviiq"}," ",{"t":"Exdash Exiviiq","r":"character:exdash-exiviiq"},", every point of HP matters even more. If Hollow Heart or Pummarola are unavailable, don't be afraid to take Armor."]},{"c":["Armor increases retaliatory damage from ",{"i":"Sprite-NO_FUTURE.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:no-future"}," ",{"t":"NO FUTURE","r":"weapon:no-future"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Heart_of_Fire_(XIX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:heart-of-fire-xix"}," ",{"t":"Heart of Fire (XIX)","r":"weapon:heart-of-fire-xix"},", and Crimson Shroud."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["It also increases the damage for the explosions of ",{"i":"Sprite-Out_of_Bounds_(XII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:out-of-bounds-xii"}," ",{"t":"Out of Bounds (XII)","r":"weapon:out-of-bounds-xii"},"; it is unknown if this is intended or an oversight."]},{"c":["It does not deal retaliatory damage by itself; it only increases retaliatory damage from other sources."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Armor_(old).png","w":120,"h":86,"c":["The old design of the Armor icon."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 27 October 2021 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["The Armor sprite had an old design. It is likely inspired from the ",{"t":"Iron Plate","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Iron_Plate"}," from the ",{"t":"Castlevania series","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/castlevania"},"."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}